    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*3 Bed End Terrace*\r\n\r\nOldgrange Manor, presented by Kelly Hudson Properties, is a new development of A-rated homes in Monasterevin, designed for modern family living.\r\nThese energy-efficient homes feature well-proportioned layouts, quality finishes, and practical living spaces tailored to everyday life. \r\nFor first-time buyers, the development qualifies for the Help to Buy Scheme & First Home Scheme, helping to make homeownership more accessible.\r\nOld Grange Manor strikes a highly practical “sweet spot” for modern living — it combines commuter convenience, everyday amenities, and a quieter residential setting in one balanced location. \r\nIt benefits from being:\r\n•\tWithin walking distance of Monasterevin town centre, with easy access to shops, schools, and the train station \r\n•\tJust minutes from the M7 motorway, providing swift connections to Dublin and beyond \r\n•\tYou can also enjoy canal walks with the Grand Canal close by or scenic walks through Moore Abbey Woods.\r\n•\tShort drive to the ever-popular Kildare Village Designer Outlet\r\n\r\nWhether you're starting out or looking to settle in a commuter town, Oldgrange Manor presents an excellent opportunity to own a stylish, energy-efficient home in a growing community. Your house hunting ends here!"
      },
